</given-names></name><name><surname>Renger</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Vater</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Witt</surname><given-names>HT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Properties of the photoactive chlorophyll-aII in photosynthesis.</article-title><source>Z. Naturforsch. B</source><year>1969</year><volume>24</volume><fpage>1139</fpage><lpage>1143</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4390753</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Duysens</surname><given-names>JNM</given-names></name><name><surname>Amesz</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Kamp</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Two photochemical systems in photosynthesis.</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>1961</year><volume>190</volume><fpage>510</fpage><lpage>511</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">13725322</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Emerson</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Lews</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The dependence of the quantum yield of chlorella photosynthesis on wave length of light.</article-title><source>Amer. J. Bot.</source><year>1943</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>165</fpage><lpage>178</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Evans</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Exploring chlorophyll fluorescence with a multilayer leaf model.</article-title><source>Plant Cell Physiol</source><year>2009</year><volume>50</volume><fpage>698</fpage><lpage>706</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Farq